WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:01.870
Rally!

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:02.990
Blitz!

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:03.890
Nerve!

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.040
Taka!

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.210
There's no need to be suspicious.  
I've come here at Yusei's request.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.470
Something must have happened.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.550
Is everyone okay?

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.900
Sorry, but no one's here.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.800
Everyone, be safe.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.690
Max…  Annie…

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.740
For you, I promise I'll...

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.980
Yusei!

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:47.780
I'll win and accomplish my mission!

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:14.420
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.440
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:27.970
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:33.910
Break through even further

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:39.510
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:46.570
There's always only one truth

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:50.410
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.260
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.290
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:36.360
Bommer’s Revenge
Trap of Sadness  Chariot Pile

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.950
It's now the third turn of the duel!

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.380
And Bommer's attack now begins!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.640
My turn.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.310
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE 
attacks Speed Warrior!

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.470
Yusei has spun out!

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:04.450
He's managed to regain control 
and is chasing Bommer!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:10.350
With Speed World, for every 1000 points of 
damage you take at one time, you lose one Speed Counter!

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:16.490
Since he took 2100 points of damage, Yusei's 
Speed Counter has returned to zero!

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:17.600
Yusei!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.010
Hang in there, Bro!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.780
You're going to lose already?

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.260
Bring it, Yusei!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:31.530
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.160
My turn.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:42.460
Once during my turn, the card 
I play will be destroyed.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.410
From my hand, I summon Shield Warrior.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:55.110
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's 
monster effect now activates!

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:01.550
When you summon a monster, that card is 
destroyed and you take 800 points of damage.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.430
Sharpshooting!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:12.070
Yusei spins out again!

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:14.310
I set one card and end my turn.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:19.150
This battle is one-sided!  
Bommer is too strong!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.300
Yusei has zero monsters on his field!

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:26.270
If he takes a direct attack on the 
next turn, the duel will be over!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:32.680
If Yusei summons a monster and it's quickly 
destroyed, there's nothing he can do!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:36.400
I didn't know I was battling 
against someone that tough!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:39.060
Lua, you finally realized that now?

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:42.800
This is bad!  With the next 
attack, it's over for Bro!

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.740
But Yusei hasn't given up 
yet.  He still has a chance.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.830
How?

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:53.300
On the previous turn, Yusei calculated that 
the monster he summoned would be destroyed.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:57.730
Once during the opponent's 
turn, Flying Fortress SKY

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.730
FIRE's monster effect destroys a 
summoned monster or a set card.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:06.780
On the previous turn, Yusei set a 
card after his monster was destroyed.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:11.120
That means his true goal 
wasn't to summon a monster!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:11.940
Yeah.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.890
It was to set a card.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:19.040
That means it's a card that can turn 
the tables, such as Mirror Force.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.510
Yusei has two set cards.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.510
How will Bommer interpret this situation?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.430
My turn!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:33.630
There's a chance that your 
set card can turn the tables.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:38.300
However, Flying Fortress SKY FIRE 
has another monster effect that

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:42.300
lets me destroy one card on the field 
by discarding one card from my hand.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:47.360
Even if you set a card after 
summoning a monster, you

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:51.360
cannot escape Flying Fortress 
SKY FIRE's destruction effect.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.850
But you would have known that.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:57.640
Therefore, the true reason 
you played that was...

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:00.160
I get it!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.190
I know what you're actually planning!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:08.460
You want me to have as few cards in my 
hand as possible in the later turns!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.710
In that case...

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:14.810
Yusei!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.470
I attack you directly!

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.040
Attack me directly?

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.250
I activate the trap Wild Tornado.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:28.020
This card destroys one spell or trap card.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.630
I'm destroying this card!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.220
You're destroying your own card?

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:39.240
When this card is destroyed, I can Special 
Summon Speed Warrior from my graveyard.

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:52.210
So you withstood my attack.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:55.750
However, all you have left now 
are the cards in your hand!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:07:00.640
Impressive, Bommer.  You 
analyzed my entire strategy.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.800
Himuro, he did something completely 
different than what you said.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.820
I feel ashamed.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.560
My turn.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.930
Yusei!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.790
Rally…

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.660
I summon Fortress Warrior from my hand!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:32.270
Now Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's 
monster effect activates!

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:38.710
When you play a card, that card is destroyed 
and you take 800 points of damage!

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.570
Sharpshooting!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:57.530
Bommer has finally passed Yusei!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.410
I activate the Speed Spell Zero Reverse!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.150
When I have three or more Speed Counters, 
I can Special Summon the monster that

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:10.150
was destroyed this turn due to an effect 
and it returns with zero attack points.

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.450
With zero attack points, you can't defeat me!

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:20.600
Here's a good luck charm.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:23.580
This is…

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.390
Turbo Booster.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.970
But you love this.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:30.490
Yeah, but it's fine.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.870
Use it to get through that pipeline.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.290
That's right, Bommer.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.130
I also have people I need to protect.

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:45.830
When I successfully summon a monster, I'm 
allowed to Special Summon this monster.

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.400
Here we go, Rally!

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.010
I Special Summon Turbo Booster.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:01.730
Fortress Warrior attacks 
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:04.360
Why would you do that 
with zero attack points?

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.800
Turbo Booster's monster effect.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:13.610
By releasing it, your monster that 
battles against my monster is destroyed.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:18.000
However, due to battle damage, 
you'll take 3000 points of damage!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:22.540
Once a turn, Fortress Warrior can 
make battle damage become zero.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.210
I release Turbo Booster.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:38.170
Yusei destroyed Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:10.050
Yusei destroyed Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.180
I activate the Continuous Trap Chariot Pile!

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:22.030
I won't lose!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:30.510
Bommer, the opening ceremonies are about 
to start.  Please come to the stadium.

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:35.010
Bommer?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:46.880
Bommer, I didn’t believe 
you until I went there, but

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:52.880
what you said was true.  It’s 
tragic.  May they rest in peace.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:07.360
Until I accomplish my mission, 
I can't lose to you!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.020
My turn!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.710
Chariot Pile's effect activates!

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:18.180
Once a turn, you take 800 points of damage!

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:21.850
You can negate this effect 
by releasing a monster.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:24.690
What will you do, Yusei?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:29.850
I release Fortress Warrior 
to negate the damage!

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:36.810
You managed to block it 
by releasing a monster.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:39.340
I end my turn.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.910
My turn.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:47.500
I'm counting on you, Junk Synchron.

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:50.080
I summon Junk Synchron.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.290
When this card is successfully 
summoned, I can

00:11:56.290 --> 00:12:00.290
Special Summon a Level 2-or-below 
monster in my graveyard.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.720
Resurrect, Speed Warrior!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:11.080
Then Junk Synchron tunes Speed Warrior!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.300
A Synchro Monster?

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:26.360
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:27.930
Synchro Summon!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.330
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.330
Attack Bommer directly!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.250
Scrap Fist!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.850
Not good enough, Yusei!

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:40.800
Chariot Pile has another effect.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:44.610
When your monster attacks 
me directly, I can pay

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:48.610
800 life points to negate 
that attack and destroy it!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.640
Just when he managed to 
summon Junk Warrior…

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:56.560
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.740
It's my turn.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.420
I summon Black Salvo!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:09.450
When this card is successfully 
summoned, I can Special Summon a

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:14.450
Level 4 Dark Attribute monster in 
my graveyard in defense position!

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:17.780
Appear, Trap Reactor ・Y FI!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:23.490
Level 3 Black Salvo tunes 
Level 4 Trap Reactor ・Y FI!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.700
A Synchro Summon?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.740
That's right!  You're not the only 
one who uses Synchro Monsters!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.370
Appear, Dark Strike Fighter!

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:42.690
Dark Strike Fighter attacks you directly!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.730
I activate my trap.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.160
Synchro Spirits.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.190
By removing a Synchro Monster in my 
graveyard from play, I can Special

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:56.190
Summon the monsters that were needed 
to Synchro Summon it from my graveyard.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.770
I remove Junk Warrior from play!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:03.050
Resurrect, Junk Synchron and Speed Warrior!

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.460
What?  Why can't I destroy it?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.570
By removing Shield Warrior 
in my graveyard from play,

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.070
I can prevent it from 
being destroyed due to battle.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:21.950
However, Chariot Pile's effect now activates!

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:25.590
Once a turn, it deals 800 points of damage!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:29.370
I release Speed Warrior to negate the damage!

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:36.380
Then I activate the trap card Ultimate Flare!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:40.880
Due to this card, I Special 
Summon an Ultimate Flare Token!

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.500
What's that token?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:49.980
It's a monster that deals 800 points of 
damage to the opponent when it's destroyed.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:53.140
By releasing a monster, Dark Strike 
Fighter's monster effect deals

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.140
the opponent damage equal to 200 times 
the Level of the released monster.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.340
Ultimate Flare Token's Level is 10.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:01.510
That means…  Umm…

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:04.930
Level 10 times 200 equals 
2000 points of damage.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.680
2000 points?

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:09.320
Now you won't be able to do anything again!

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.500
On my next turn, your life 
points will become zero!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.950
I end my turn!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.450
Now what will he do?  Yusei 
has no cards in his hand!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:22.530
He's completely cornered!  Everything 
depends on the next draw!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.000
My turn.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.560
I'm betting on this card.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.480
I summon Tuningware.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:43.030
Level 3 Junk Synchron 
tunes Level 1 Tuningware.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.120
Synchro Summon!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.300
Come, Armory Arm!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:54.010
What can you do with 1800 attack points?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:16:00.550
When Tuningware is used to Synchro Summon, 
I get to draw one card from my deck.

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:05.010
Yusei has managed to keep going, and 
this is the final draw of destiny!

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.450
Yusei!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:07.830
Bro!

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:26.090
Yusei smiled.

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:29.660
I activate the Speed Spell Synchro Return.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.580
When I have five or more 
Speed Counters, I can

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:37.580
Special Summon a Synchro Monster 
that was removed from play.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.940
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.300
Then I activate Armory Arm's monster effect!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.290
What?

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:54.940
Armory Arm equips on to a Synchro Monster 
and increases its attack points by 1000!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.530
It has more attack points 
than Dark Strike Fighter!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.340
Junk Warrior!

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:06.980
Power Gear Fist!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.940
Next is Armory Arm's effect.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:31.160
When the equipped monster 
destroys a monster in battle,

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:35.160
you take damage equal to the 
destroyed monster's attack points!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.490
What?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.510
He did it!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.100
Good.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.850
Yusei won!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.690
You did it, Bro.

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:02.510
Huh?

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:06.660
Even though the duel's over, 
Chariot Pile hasn't vanished.

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.500
Too bad.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:17.050
It seems his Signer abilities 
haven't awaken yet.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.500
How lame.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.410
Your mission amounted to nothing.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:27.790
It's over!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:33.350
Satellite's shooting star Yusei 
Fudo versus the black storm Bommer!

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:39.200
The winner of the Duel of Fortune 
Cup semifinals is Yusei Fudo!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.260
Are you okay, Bommer?

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.940
The next battle will be...

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.920
Yusei, well done.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.990
I lost.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.290
What?  What's going on?

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:55.940
Huh?  They can't hear my voice.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.650
Mic test…

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.510
I lost!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:03.200
However, my mission isn't over!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:05.140
Mission?

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:12.400
I planned to win this tournament so that during the 
ceremonies, I could publicly reveal what Godwin did.

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:15.560
However, that's no longer possible.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:18.910
Therefore, I'll get my revenge now!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:20.080
Revenge?

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.850
Look at this!

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:26.540
My village was completely destroyed!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.120
Hurry up and stop the visuals!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.610
It's fine.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.340
This is my village!  My hometown!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:44.460
In order to resurrect the Crimson Dragon, 
Godwin used my village as a testing ground!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.300
And my village was…

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:53.950
How?  How does Bommer know?

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.080
Can it be that he's a survivor?

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:07.130
All the villagers are missing, 
including my brother and sister.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.380
That means your brother and sister are...

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:13.910
Yusei!  Jack!  Don't trust him!

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:17.160
You can't let Godwin have the Crimson Dragon!

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:23.960
Bommer!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:27.970
I will settle things with 
him with my own hands!

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:33.450
For my hometown friends!  For 
my dear brother and sister!

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:37.940
For this sadness to never happen again!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.540
Bommer!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:50.730
What?

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:06.410
Your hand…

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:14.390
Yusei!

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.890
Why did you stop me?  Why?

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:20.370
Bommer, I can't forgive him either.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:25.930
But if you try to settle things by 
force, then you're no better than him.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.080
Yusei!

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:10.100
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:15.490
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:21.410
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:26.650
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:29.810
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:35.400
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:42.560
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:47.960
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.390 --> 00:22:53.900
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:59.240
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:05.300
